{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫選秀節目《中年好聲音》首季總冠軍周吉佩（吉吉）近年事業版圖不斷擴張，近日更正式「升呢」成為音樂學校老闆兼星級導師。名師出高徒，吉吉親自領軍打造全新 4 人跳唱女團 SHEro，成員包括隊長 Alice（曾琸庭）、Ahri（溫珮晴）、SY（李倩盈） 及 Anton（韓玟曦）。四女於今年 8 月以「港版 BLACKPINK...</p>\n<p>無綫選秀節目《中年好聲音》首季總冠軍周吉佩（吉吉）近年事業版圖不斷擴張，近日更正式「升呢」成為音樂學校老闆兼星級導師。名師出高徒，吉吉親自領軍打造全新 4 人跳唱女團 SHEro，成員包括隊長 Alice（曾琸庭）、Ahri（溫珮晴）、SY（李倩盈） 及 Anton（韓玟曦）。四女於今年 8 月以「港版 BLACKPINK」之勢強勢登場，憑藉驕人身材與超凡舞功，無懼向人氣高企的「魔音女團」MYNT 下戰書，目標直指今年樂壇「組合新人獎」！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489203362455578_10989399016afbe102a5d42.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1794027602_4024579974799936525_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489203362455578_10989399016afbe102a5d42.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@shero.official_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489203812042526_21170984846afbe1066eaea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"katchau86_1783782712_3938972914992591431_10526911.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489203812042526_21170984846afbe1066eaea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>吉吉親自領軍打造全新 4 人跳唱女團 SHEro（圖片來源：IG@katchau86）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>24歲隊長Alice曾琸庭曾戰選秀節目《就是青春》奪佳績</h2>\n<p>24歲隊長Alice曾琸庭無疑是全隊擁有最豐富實戰經驗的核心人物，當年為了追逐演藝夢想毅然放棄遠赴澳洲修讀物理治療課程。她早在2022年便憑藉過人實力參加選秀節目《就是青春》並勇奪第4名，直到今年8月正式以SHEro隊長身分霸氣登場。獲老闆周吉佩公開稱讚性格「好玩」兼極具觀眾緣，面對硬撼強敵MYNT爭奪新人獎的激烈局面，她代表團隊發言時毫不怯場，更霸氣直言對獲獎「非常有信心」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204081287383_16076174716afbe1091dc5b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"alice.tsang.0425_1789558657_3987429445489003544_1514559246.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204081287383_16076174716afbe1091dc5b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alice.tsang.0425）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204378035939_19625926546afbe10c2e2b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"alice.tsang.0425_1785409581_3952622829699042896_1514559246.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204378035939_19625926546afbe10c2e2b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alice.tsang.0425）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204519672156_7563963216afbe10d9400f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"alice.tsang.0425_1730725089_3493897742039322920_1514559246.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204519672156_7563963216afbe10d9400f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alice.tsang.0425）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204696493635_7199341136afbe10f45bee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"alice.tsang.0425_1725277811_3448202661022385418_1514559246.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489204696493635_7199341136afbe10f45bee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@alice.tsang.0425）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>29歲Ahri溫珮晴兩度參選選美盛事 化身低音炮女聲</h2>\n<p>現年29歲成員Ahri溫珮晴入行前曾赴英國留學並從事金融業工作，同時擁有選美佳麗與金融才女雙重亮眼光環。她曾先後於2024年及2025年兩度挑戰《香港環球小姐》選美舞台並成功殺入15強，直到今年正式轉戰樂壇展現全新面貌。在隊內擔任知性代表及主攻低音聲部的她，憑藉極具辨識度嗓音獲周吉佩點名激讚「唱中低音最勁」，成功為團隊多首快節奏跳唱作品提供穩重而具壓倒性氣勢支撐。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948920491918329_15394850766afbe1118aff1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ahri.wpc_1758715113_3728695081089088851_237732148.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948920491918329_15394850766afbe1118aff1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>曾先後於2024年及2025年兩度挑戰《香港環球小姐》選美舞台並成功殺入15強（圖片來源：IG@ahri.wpc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205066514136_21089149006afbe1130c2cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ahri.wpc_1692106929_3169945135345366606_237732148.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205066514136_21089149006afbe1130c2cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ahri.wpc）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205229481890_9705596126afbe114c726e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ahri.wpc_1783594803_3937380322389314730_237732148.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205229481890_9705596126afbe114c726e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ahri.wpc）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205690833618_10490430726afbe11964af3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ahri.wpc_1783594803_3937380322431206869_237732148.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489205690833618_10490430726afbe11964af3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ahri.wpc）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>23歲「烘焙導師」李倩盈大玩反差展現超凡舞蹈實力</h2>\n<p>年僅23歲成員SY李倩盈以斜槓族模式活躍於演藝圈與飲食界，入行前已經是一名獨當一面蛋糕店主兼烘焙導師。外表甜美溫柔的她只要一踏上舞台便會瞬間爆發極大反差感，展現出令人驚豔超凡跳舞功架，因此毫無懸念地獲周吉佩認證為全隊「跳舞比較勁」舞蹈擔當。私底下性格搞笑活潑李倩盈更是團隊中不可或缺開心果，為了配合團隊強烈跳唱風格，她更大方公開表示完全不介意在舞台上作出大膽性感演出。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948920605578087_6599239916afbe11dc4aec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1763731513_3770775698488270302_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948920605578087_6599239916afbe11dc4aec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489206538982858_1071235316afbe1220096e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1791381470_4002719465157200848_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489206538982858_1071235316afbe1220096e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489206931169572_15082630596afbe125bc60e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1717993469_3387097171689534795_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489206931169572_15082630596afbe125bc60e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207140027386_14529998056afbe12810ee5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1748426233_3642385703193239985_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207140027386_14529998056afbe12810ee5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207397393793_61954456afbe12a5fa04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1748426233_3642385703360958931_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207397393793_61954456afbe12a5fa04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207580513993_6617251036afbe12c316f7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"sy.ing__1748255681_3640955006368775699_2025843755.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207580513993_6617251036afbe12c316f7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>學院派新人韓玟曦獲周吉佩認證內藏陰暗面</h2>\n<p>作為4女之中年紀最輕成員Anton韓玟曦剛於香港城市大學完成學業便全情投入女團嚴格特訓，以充滿神秘感學院派新人姿態強勢加盟。雖然她一直未有對外公開實際年齡，但其獨特個人氣質已經成功引起外界高度關注。星級導師周吉佩對這位生力軍給予極具話題性評價，形容她「表面斯文，但內裏有陰暗面」，正因為這種充滿衝突感強烈性格反差，讓她能夠輕易駕馭不同極端曲風並在舞台上展露驚人歌唱潛能。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207777860103_11876676366afbe12e32a19.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"anton.x.ia_1761557472_3752538520930060593_2267611567.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489207777860103_11876676366afbe12e32a19.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208035111134_4300454856afbe1311d936.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"anton.x.ia_1754468993_3693076050302636941_2267611567.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208035111134_4300454856afbe1311d936.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208266891656_1177948126afbe1337ef6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"anton.x.ia_1783335704_3935226185977767334_2267611567.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208266891656_1177948126afbe1337ef6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208728186154_10771704546afbe137abc28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"anton.x.ia_1715701138_3367867707629975263_2267611567.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489208728186154_10771704546afbe137abc28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sy.ing_）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:19:30.813270+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1921,"images":20,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:08:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:58.912271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:56.885559+00:00","content_hash":"30e85bcf48ca011600154a966c88876990ef8d8a53913dd88cd3cb7892069bec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}